{"name":"It’s My Party","hex":"#cc7365","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"party","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person or group of people constituting one side in a legal proceeding, such as in a legal action or a contract. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A person; an individual."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To celebrate at a party, to have fun, to enjoy oneself.","To take recreational drugs."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/party"}],"entries":[{"title":"It's My Party","blocks":[{"text":"\"It's My Party\" is the debut song recorded by American singer Lesley Gore on her debut studio album I'll Cry If I Want To (1963). It was released as her debut single on April 5, 1963, by Mercury Records. The song was written by Herb Wiener, John Gluck Jr. and Wally Gold, and produced by Quincy Jones."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3e/It%27s_My_Party_single_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/It's_My_Party"},{"title":"My Party","blocks":[{"text":"\"My Party\" is the debut single by German female singer, DJ and musician DJane HouseKat featuring vocals from Rameez. The single was released digitally on March 19, 2012 in Germany. The song was written by Axel Konrad, Alvin J. Fields, Michael James Zager and Chima Rameez Okpalaugo (Rameez). It is based on the 1978 Michael Zager Band hit \"Let's All Chant\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ce/MyPartyDJane.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Party"},{"title":"Party","blocks":[{"text":"A party is a gathering of people who have been invited by a host for the purposes of socializing, conversation, recreation, or as part of a festival or other commemoration or celebration of a special occasion. A party will often feature food and beverages, and generally conversation, music, dancing, or other forms of entertainment."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Hip%2C_Hip%2C_Hurrah%21_Artists%E2%80%99_Party%2C_Skagen_%28Peder_Severin_Kr%C3%B8yer%29_-_Gothenburg_Museum_of_Art_-_F_62.tif/lossy-page1-330px-Hip%2C_Hip%2C_Hurrah%21_Artists%E2%80%99_Party%2C_Skagen_%28Peder_Severin_Kr%C3%B8yer%29_-_Gothenburg_Museum_of_Art_-_F_62.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Party"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/3e/It%27s_My_Party_single_cover.jpg/250px-It%27s_My_Party_single_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3e/It%27s_My_Party_single_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/3e/It%27s_My_Party_single_cover.jpg/250px-It%27s_My_Party_single_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIt's_My_Party_single_cover.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/86/Lesley_Gore_-_It%27s_My_Party.jpg/250px-Lesley_Gore_-_It%27s_My_Party.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/86/Lesley_Gore_-_It%27s_My_Party.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/86/Lesley_Gore_-_It%27s_My_Party.jpg/250px-Lesley_Gore_-_It%27s_My_Party.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALesley_Gore_-_It's_My_Party.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/09/StewartGaskinItsMyParty.jpg/250px-StewartGaskinItsMyParty.jpg?utm_s